<%#
AVR home page. Replaces upstream's homepage-splash block in catalog/index.html.erb.

Kept in its own partial so index.html.erb's AVR delta is a single line: upstream
reworks that file most releases (facet sidebar, constraints rendering, test ids),
and when it does you can take upstream's version wholesale and re-point the one
branch here. See docs/AVR_UPGRADE.md.

Styled by app/assets/stylesheets/northwestern/components/_layout.scss --
.hero / .hero-image / .contain-1120 / .contain-970 / .section-top, and
.section-top needs the `homepage-main` class layouts/avalon.html.erb puts on
<main> for the root path. The hero's splash image is
app/assets/images/northwestern/avr-splash-image-reels-cropped-muted.jpg.
%>
<div class="full-width-page">
  <section class="hero">
    <%# The hero image can align left/center/right on mobile by changing
        background-position on .hero-image. %>
    <div class="hero-image homepage">
      <div class="contain-1120">
        <h1>Repository Audio + Video</h1>
        <p>Audio and video material for courses</p>
        <%= link_to 'Browse Collection',
                    main_app.search_catalog_path(search_field: 'all_fields', q: ''),
                    class: "button" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="content">
    <section>
      <div class="section-top contain-970">
        <h2>Looking for Audio and Video material for Research?</h2>
        <p>
          All non-course media has moved to
          <%= link_to 'Northwestern University Libraries Digital Collections',
                      'https://dc.library.northwestern.edu/search?WorkType=%5B%22Audio%22%2C%22Video%22%5D' %>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
